  "overview": "The lives of four characters collide during a tragic robbery at a tobacco shop.  Alberto is the owner of the tobacco shop. The night before the robbery, his wife, Marta, discovers that he has cheated on her. He tries to convince her to stay, but she leaves.  Laura is the shop assistant and Alberto’s lover. She believes she can finally be with him, but the conversation she has been waiting for is interrupted by the robbery.  Javier is a customer at the tobacco shop who owes money to a dealer. He tries to win it in a poker game the night before the robbery.  Diego lives with his seriously ill father. Their financial situation forces Diego to rob the tobacco shop.",
